<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2244" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἅιδης</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾅδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, 
			Att.
		; 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀΐδης</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ao</i> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εω</span>; 
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ʼΑΐδας,</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, used by Trag., in lyr.and anap.: gen.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">῎Αϊδος</span>, dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">῎Αϊδι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, Trag., v. infr.: (perh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ-</span> priv., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰδεῖν</span>):—in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only as pr.n. <u>Hades</u>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς καὶ ἐγώ, τρίτατος δ᾽ Αΐδης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.188
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				455
			</span></i>:—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰν᾽ Αΐδαο
			δόμοισι</span> in the <i>nether</i> world, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.834
			</span></i>; freq. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰν, εἰς Αΐδαο</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόμοις, δόμους</span>), as <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.389
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				21.48
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰν Ἄϊδος</span> Il <i><span class="en">
				24.593
			</span></i>; Trag. and 
				Att.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν Ἅιδου, εἰς Ἅιδου</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴκῳ, οἶκον</span>), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				865
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				69
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄϊδόσδε</span>,
				Adv.
			<i>to the nether world</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				7.330
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρ᾽ Ἅιδῃ, παρ᾽
			Ἅιδην</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OT</u>
				972
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OC</u>
				1552
			</span></i>:—hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>place of departed spirits</i>, first in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.244
			</span></i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσόκεν αὐτὸς . . Ἄϊδι κεύθωμαι;
					ἐπὶ τὸν ᾅδην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Cat.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἀΐδην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ ᾅδῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					16.23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> after <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, <i>the grave, death</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀΐδαν
				λαγχάνειν, δέξασθαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				5.96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>I.</u>
				6(5).15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾅδης πόντιος</span>
			<i>death</i> by sea, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				667
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1047
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾅδου πύλη</span>, Astrol.,
			region below the Horoscope, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				179.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾅδου</span> with nouns in adjectival sense,
				<i>devilish</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύουσαν ᾅ. μητέρ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1235
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾅ. μάγειρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					397
				</span></i>
			; <i>fatal, deadly</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκτυον,
				ξίφη ᾅ.</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1115
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1399
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> in all forms exc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱῐδος</span> before
			vowels; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱῐδης</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Semon.
				7.117
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1689
			</span></i>.]</div>
